.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Represents a generic \fBAI\fP model instance within the SystemEX framework\&. 

This class acts as the high‑level controller for:
.IP "\(bu" 2
Model configuration (capabilities, environment, runtime settings)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Tool registration and management
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBBackend\fP interaction (Begin, RunAsync, End)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Prompt execution and session handling
.PP

.PP
The model is generic over: \fIT\fP  → The prompt/input type \fITTOOL\fP  → The runtime tool type used by the backend

.PP
A model does NOT execute \fBAI\fP logic itself\&. Instead, it delegates all execution to the backend (\fBIModelBackend<T, TTOOL>\fP)\&. 
.PP
